        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cream satin, backed with coarse linen embroidered with polychrome twisted silk yarns in satin stitch. More or less symmetrical spray of carnations, morning-glories, primroses, etc. in somewhat fanciful colors. Stitches pass through both the satin and linen. Satin soiled. Edges ragged."@en ;
